              "latex": "10^\\circ",
              "display": false
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": ". After driving 3 km further in a straight line, the tower is in the direction due west, with angle of elevation ",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "latex": "12^\\circ",
              "display": false
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
