        "code": "% mathsmap-diagram-colours {\"version\":1,\"kind\":\"geometry\",\"base\":[],\"semantic\":[],\"reference\":\"page 17 question 12 plan\"}\n\\begin{tikzpicture}[line width=0.8pt]\n\\special{dvisvgm:raw <metadata data-graph-strokes=\"1\"/>}\n\\coordinate (F) at (0,0);\\coordinate (A) at (0,-2.6);\\coordinate (B) at (1.9,0);\n\\draw[<->,line width=0.5pt] (0,-3.3)--(0,0.8);\\draw[<->,line width=0.5pt] (-0.8,0)--(3,0);\n\\draw (A)--(B) node[midway,right] {$3\\text{ km}$};\n\\node[above] at (0,0.8) {N};\\node[below] at (0,-3.3) {S};\\node[left] at (-0.8,0) {W};\\node[right] at (3,0) {E};\n\\node[below left] at (F) {$F$};\\node[left] at (A) {$A$};\\node[above] at (B) {$B$};\n\\end{tikzpicture}",
